  <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/If%20keyword"><span class="kw1">if</span></a>  HasEffect<span class="br0">&#40;</span>attacker, EFFECT_TYPE_MISDIRECTION_HEX<span class="br0">&#41;</span>
